#autoload
#
# Completion for `gp pl`, the shorthand for `gp pr list`. Rather than restate
# that grammar here and let the two drift apart, rewrite the word array into
# the form _gp-pr expects (`pr list ...`) and hand off to it — so the
# shorthand always completes exactly like the command it stands for.
words=(pr list "${(@)words[2,-1]}")
(( CURRENT += 1 ))
_gp-pr
